  "description": "European Central Bank (ECB) euro foreign-exchange reference-rate provider for Bodu.Financial. Downloads and parses the ECB's published eurofxref XML feeds and serves them as Bodu.Financial.ExchangeRates.ExchangeRate values through IDatedRateProvider and IRateProvider, with an async range API and in-memory plus on-disk caching. Includes the dependency-injection registration extensions (AddEcbExchangeRates) for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection, with options binding and a resilient named HttpClient.",
